│ to have their antipsychotic medication stopped or substantially changed, the benzodiazepine group of drugs have been │
│ suggested as a useful adjunctive treatment. However, benzodiazepines are very addictive.                             │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ Review objective:                                                                                                    │
│ To determine the effects of benzodiazepines for antipsychotic‐induced tardive dyskinesia in people with              │
│ schizophrenia, schizoaffective disorder, or other chronic mental illnesses.                                          │
│                                                                                                                      │
